Z||000003||Raydar||09-25-2001||01:08 PM||||You might be looking for Butyl Rubber. It comes in a tube, like silicone. I believe it's easier to remove, though. <BR>That's what I used to reseal the plastic trim on my T-top car. (The black plastic pieces that are between the glass and the rear clip.)<P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT>||||reg||1
